config FBACCEL
	tristate "Meta Accelerator Host Driver"
	depends on PCI
	select DMA_SHARED_BUFFER
	select FW_LOADER
	select GENERIC_ALLOCATOR
	select SERIAL_CORE
	help
	  This option enables a driver for Meta's accelerator silicon devices.

	  This driver supports a set of silicon devices that (mostly) share a
	  common firmware interface.  This currently includes video transcoding
	  and machine learning accelerators, but may be leveraged for additional
	  accelerators in the future.
